{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14108080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1410808001:0":{"text":"오늘은 달이 참 아름답네. 약속을 지킨 것을 보니 기쁘군.","source_cn":"晚上好，你们如约前来，我为你们的信任感到高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE22272199F0C42DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410808002:0":{"text":"인듀어가 궁전에 갇혀 있다고? 의심하고 싶진 않지만, 궁전에 감옥이 있을 거라고는 생각도 못했네.","source_cn":"你说因度厄被关在宫殿里？我不想质疑你的话，我只是没想到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AAB69F9DF1C03D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410808003:0":{"text":"나의 <style=\"highlight\">위대하신 어머니</style>께서는 취향이 원체 독특하셔서 궁전에 무엇을 지어도 이상하지 않지.","source_cn":"我<style=highlight>伟大的母亲</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53A271855FE064D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1410808003":{"text":"나의 <style=\"highlight\">위대하신 어머니</style>께서는 취향이 원체 독특하셔서 궁전에 무엇을 지어도 이상하지 않지.","source_cn":"我<style=highlight>伟大的母亲</style>一向审美奇特，她在宫殿里建什么都不奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53A271855FE064D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410808004:0":{"text":"놀라운가? 이미 알고 있지 않았나.","source_cn":"很惊讶吗？你不是早就知道了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1637E2538F01AD38","variant_st